			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740020301,
					"content": "我們之前是不是在空中，在泡泡裡向上飛來著…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020302,
					"content": "對呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020303,
					"content": "然後我們一直、一直往上飛，最後一頭栽進了水裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020304,
					"content": "嗯，有什麼問題嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020305,
					"content": "呃，問題太多了，一時之間不知道從哪裡開始說好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020306,
						740020307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020306,
					"content": "就當是水仙十字王國的神奇之處吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740020308,
					"content": "…好啦好啦，我不問就是了！按照之前的說法，莉利絲公主的「寶物」就在這附近嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020309,
					"content": "嗯。就在那邊，被三重的封印守護著。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020310,
					"content": "在哪裡？喔，是那個嗎？雖然外面的大泡泡很大，但寶物裝在很小的寶箱裡…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020311,
					"content": "仔細一看，大泡泡外還連著一些水流一樣的東西…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020312,
					"content": "看來這邊的水泡陣地出於某種原因並不會攻擊我們呢。嗯，就用它來解除封印吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020313,
					"content": "將它發射的泡泡，<color=#00E1FFFF>引導到那個水流連接的圓環</color>上，泡泡的破壞力就會透過水流傳導過去，削弱封印的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020314,
					"content": "畢竟，那些泡泡真的很可怕呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020315,
					"content": "一、二、三…似乎<color=#00E1FFFF>有三股水流</color>，將這些都解決了，就能拿到寶物了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020316,
					"content": "#嗯！拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們了，{NICKNAME}騎士、派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "？？？"
				},
				{
					"id": 740020307,
					"content": "誰也不想被重力束縛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740020308
					]
				}
			]
		},
