				{
					"id": 740030105,
					"content": "這裡…在我們來之前很久很久，就已經有這間藏書室了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030106,
					"content": "書中的內容似乎是很古老的戲劇劇本。孩子們很喜歡看書，但有很多東西看不懂，經常纏著大人講給他們聽。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030107,
					"content": "在故事當中，如果有惡龍，就會有征討惡龍的勇者；如果有巫師，就會有流浪而來的騎士。國土總會光復，公主總會獲救。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030108,
					"content": "…當然，最後自鳴鐘總會響起，冒險故事於是告一段落。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030109,
					"content": "但冒險故事永遠也不會結束，總會有下一場冒險、下下一場冒險、下下下一場冒險，直到孩子們長大，將故事留下，離開這裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030110,
					"content": "安？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030111,
					"content": "啊？抱歉…剛剛感覺有一些記憶和感情，像潮水一樣沖了過來。真奇怪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030112,
					"content": "是喔…你沒事就好，看你突然說這些，我還以為是中了什麼納西索斯的邪惡幻術呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030113,
					"content": "哇！搞不好真的是這樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030114,
					"content": "唔…接下來，我們應該怎麼辦呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030115,
					"content": "我也不知道…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030116,
					"content": "總之，先觀察一下吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740030117,
					"content": "嗯！首先…那邊有個門。不過，看起來沒辦法通過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030118,
					"content": "你們應該能過去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740030119,
					"content": "#喂！現在{F#妳}{M#你}可是安的{NICKNAME}騎士，{F#妳}{M#你}要是不一起來就沒意義了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030120,
					"content": "嗯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030121,
					"content": "這一塊地板看起來也很讓人在意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030122,
						740030123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030122,
					"content": "說不定也是通道？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740030124,
					"content": "不知道耶…總之，我們出發吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740030123,
					"content": "說不定是陷阱…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740030103,
					"content": "是書店？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740030104,
					"content": "哪來的楓丹地下秘密書店遺蹟啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740030105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}